ies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"The `timeout` input parameter is default to 10 minutes:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/actions/deploy-pages/blob/af48cf94a42f2c634308b1c9dc0151830b6f190a/action.yml#L12-L15\r\n\r\nHowever, that value is actually more than _just_ a default, it is also effectively a maximum as it also has to contend with the Pages deployment service's backend-enforced timeout of 10 minutes.\r\n\r\nWe should:\r\n- [ ] Input the `action.yml` description to explain that\r\n- [ ] Warn if that input parameter's value exceeds 10 minutes with an explanatory error message\r\n  - [ ] This should probably be upgraded to an outright failure of the action step in a future major version bump","closed_by":{"login":"JamesMGreene","id":417751,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxNzc1MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/417751?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JamesMGreene","html_url":"https://github.com/JamesMGreene","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JamesMGreene/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JamesMGreene/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JamesMGreene/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JamesMGreene/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JamesMGreene/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JamesMGreene/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JamesMGreene/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JamesMGreene/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JamesMGreene/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":true},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/actions/deploy-pages/issues/165/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/actions/deploy-pages/is